## 3. Disposition

The M2 local result as corrected: certified host; exact compression `B(λ) = (1−9λ)VᵀMV`; simple transversal flip at `λ_c = (1+1/m₁)/9` (enclosed); certified `c > 0` (supercritical); `|W| = |W_q|√(σμ/c)(1 + O(μ)) ≈ 25.0√μ`, azimuth `31.534°`, full period-two `H`-symmetric cycle with alternating `W`; cycle two-step multiplier `1 − 4σμ + O(μ²)`. Open: neighbourhood size, G2 (entrance entry), relation to the `λ = 0.5` orbit. **Codex's independent review remains required before M2 is recorded as jointly accepted.** No implementation follows.
